          "elements": [
            {
              "id": "b2c3d4e3",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "html",
              "isInner": false,
              "settings": {
                "html": "<section class=\"intro intro--tight\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"intro__content\">\n      <p>Plastic-Craft supplies high-performance plastics for laboratory, research, pharmaceutical, biotech, and life sciences environments. In settings where even the smallest contamination can compromise an experiment or production run, the right plastic ensures safe, long-lasting, and chemically inert performance.</p>\n      <p>Our specialist team identifies the right materials for your application and fabricates custom solutions engineered to exact specifications. All welding, forming, tooling, and assembly is performed at our facility &mdash; delivering reliable materials, fast turnaround, and consistent quality whether your focus is pharmaceutical production, clinical research, medical device innovation, or industrial laboratory operations.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
              },
              "elements": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c3d4e5f1",
      "elType": "section",
      "isInner": false,
      "settings": {
        "layout": "full_width"
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "c3d4e5f2",
          "elType": "column",
          "isInner": false,
          "settings": {
            "_column_size": 100
          },
          "elements": [
            {
              "id": "c3d4e5f3",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "html",
              "isInner": false,
              "settings": {
                "html": "<section class=\"applications\" id=\"applications\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"applications__layout\">\n      <div class=\"applications__image\">\n        <img src=\"\" alt=\"Pharmaceutical and research plastics\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"background:#d0e9fd;min-height:480px;\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"applications__body\">\n        <h2>Our Applications</h2>\n        <div class=\"applications__tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n          <button class=\"applications__tab active\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"panel-lab\" id=\"tab-lab\">Laboratory &amp; Research</button>\n          <button class=\"applications__tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"panel-pharma\" id=\"tab-pharma\">Pharmaceutical &amp; Medical</button>\n          <button class=\"applications__tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"panel-industrial\" id=\"tab-industrial\">Industrial &amp; Chemical</button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"applications__panel active\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"panel-lab\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-lab\">\n          <ul class=\"applications__list\">\n            <li>Laboratory equipment, instruments, and diagnostic trays</li>\n            <li>Lab countertops and processing areas</li>\n            <li>Fume hoods and ducting</li>\n            <li>Research-grade safety barriers, shields, and trays</li>\n            <li>Cleanroom-compatible containers and equipment</li>\n            <li>HPLC tubing and valve components</li>\n            <li>Fluid handling tubing, manifolds, and fittings</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"applications__panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"panel-pharma\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-pharma\">\n          <ul class=\"applications__list\">\n            <li>Pill and tablet production equipment</li>\n            <li>Blister packaging, strip packs, pouches, and sample packs</li>\n            <li>Pre-fillable syringes, IV infusion devices, inhalers, and insulin pens</li>\n            <li>Medication tubes, droppers, vials, ampules, and single-dose bottles</li>\n            <li>Tamper-evident and childproof closures</li>\n            <li>Measuring spoons, caps, and dosing systems</li>\n            <li>Renal care and bio-pharm facilities</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"applications__panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"panel-industrial\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-industrial\">\n          <ul class=\"applications__list\">\n            <li>Municipal water and wastewater piping</li>\n            <li>Drain-waste-vent systems</li>\n            <li>Chemical containers for storage or retention</li>\n            <li>Plating tanks, barrels, and parts</li>\n            <li>Tanks, tanker linings, and wall linings</li>\n            <li>Pump and valve components, gaskets, seals, and spacers</li>\n            <li>High-purity semiconductor industry</li>\n            <li>Pulp and paper bleaching</li>\n            <li>Mining and metals preparation</li>\n            <li>Underground transport and fuel holding</li>\n            <li>Food and beverage processing and piping</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
              },
              "elements": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
